{title: Rang Dariya}
{artist: Yasser Desai}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
Ya [C] ara mujhe tu aise [G] aa mila,        Jaise ka [F] afir ko milta [C] hai khuda
K [C] arun lakh baari tera [G] shukriya,        Bin maa [F] nge toone itna [C] de diya
Mera saf [Am] eena oh paar laga de,        Y [F] a tu mita de
[G] Ya tu bana de koyi z [C] ariya,        [C] Rang dariya rang dariya
Teri [G] aankhon ka yeh rang dariya,        S [F] oofiyana ishq ka rang [C] dariya
[Am] Main bandeya jaaun rangeya,        [F] Main bandeya jaaun rangeya
[G] Be parwah kar jaaye da [F] riya,        [C] Rang dariya rang dariya
Teri [G] aankhon ka yeh rang dariya,        S [F] oofiyana ishq ka rang [C] dariya
Ch [C] ehron ki bheed mein,        T [Am] u pasand aa gaya
M [F] eri nazar mein teri,        Ta [G] sveer rehti hai
H [C] ua main ameer paake,        T [Am] eri dildariyan
S [F] unn yeh mere khwabon ki,        T [G] aabeer kehti hai
Hon [Am] a kabhi tu mujhse juda na,        C [F] hahe khudaya
[G] Chahe khafa ho saari du [C] niya,        [C] Rang dariya rang dariya
Teri [G] aankhon ka yeh rang dariya,        S [F] oofiyana ishq ka rang [C] dariya
[C] Rang dariya rang dariya,        Teri [G] aankhon ka yeh rang dariya
